    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A strategic RPG featuring three types of puzzle-like battle mechanics and a multi-ending story that changes based on the player's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of adventure will you embark on?<br>How will your journey come to an end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path you take will shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What holds the key to these branching fates?<br>Only those who progress through the tale will uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>15 different endings</strong>, there is always a reason to challenge the game again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only after witnessing every ending will the full story be revealed.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Party Choices Shape the Battle Style</strong><br>The allies you choose will <strong>drastically alter your battle strategy.</strong><br>Will you engage in <strong>puzzle-based combat where clearing specific conditions is the key to victory</strong>, or will you face <strong>a unique turn-based battle system that demands tactical decision-making</strong>?<br><strong>Your choices determine the course of battle.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Battle Systems</strong><br>Make your own three battle styles,each of which requires different puzzle-like thinking.Each time,a different mindset is required,so players' judgement is puto to the test.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A strategic RPG featuring three types of puzzle-like battle mechanics and a multi-ending story that changes based on the player's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of adventure will you embark on?<br>How will your journey come to an end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path you take will shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What holds the key to these branching fates?<br>Only those who progress through the tale will uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>15 different endings</strong>, there is always a reason to challenge the game again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only after witnessing every ending will the full story be revealed.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Party Choices Shape the Battle Style</strong><br>The allies you choose will <strong>drastically alter your battle strategy.</strong><br>Will you engage in <strong>puzzle-based combat where clearing specific conditions is the key to victory</strong>, or will you face <strong>a unique turn-based battle system that demands tactical decision-making</strong>?<br><strong>Your choices determine the course of battle.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Battle Systems</strong><br>Make your own three battle styles,each of which requires different puzzle-like thinking.Each time,a different mindset is required,so players' judgement is puto to the test.</p></li></ul>",
